dil [G#m] tod ke hansti hai,        [G#m] Ik mauj kinaare se
[B] milne ko tarasti [G#m] hai,        [G#m] Kah do na koyi [C#] roke
Kah [E] do na koyi [D#] roke,        [G#m] Hum tum se judaa [C#m] hoke
mar [B] jaayenge ro ro [G#m] ke,        Mar [D#] jaayenge ro ro [F#] ke.. [G#m]
[C#m] Sochaa thaa kabhi do dil,        [G#m] milkar na judaa honge
[G#m] Maaloom na thaa Hum yoon,        [B] naaqaam e wafaa [G#m] honge
[G#m] Qismat ne diye [C#] dhokhe,        [E] Qismat ne diye [D#] dhokhe
[G#m] Hum tum se judaa [C#m] hoke,        mar [B] jaayenge ro ro [G#m] ke
